      "end": 371,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Gpr124 is essential for blood\u2013brain barrier integrity in central nervous system disease\nWe thus identify Gpr124 as an endothelial GPCR specifically required for endothelial Wnt signaling and BBB integrity under pathological conditions in adult mice. This finding implicates Gpr124 as a potential therapeutic target for human CNS disorders characterized by BBB disruption."
